Package: linregpkg
Type: Package
Title: Multiple Linear Regression Using the QR Decomposition
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Viet Tien", "Trinh", email = "vietr933@student.liu.se", role = c("cre", "aut")),
    person("Zhengyu", "Wang", email = "zhewa470@student.liu.se", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Fits multiple linear regression models using the QR
    decomposition of the design matrix. The fitted model is returned as an
    object of class 'linreg' with methods for printing, summarising,
    extracting coefficients, residuals and fitted values, and plotting
    diagnostic plots with 'ggplot2'. Developed for the course 732A94
    Advanced R Programming at Linkoping University.
